    "title": "Lawton Approves Millions for 440 Acres to Land Secret Defense Contractor - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jordan Myers ,\n10 hours ago Lawton city leaders have agreed to spend millions of dollars acquiring 440 acres of industrial land for a defense contractor whose identity remains a closely guarded secret. The Lawton City Council approved allocating $2.2 million from four funding sources Tuesday to buy the property, with officials saying the purchase is meant to facilitate development of a new defense contractor facility. Read full article",
